                </div>
                <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                  <div class="accordion-text---solutions">To choose the cash register that best suits your restaurant's needs, it's important to check a whole range of criteria: the size of your establishment, the volume of sales, your budget, your sales volume, NF 525 certification, the functions that are essential to your day-to-day operation, how easy it is for you and your staff to get to grips with the cash register, the reliability of the provider and the integrations it offers. For expert advice, contact us!<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div id="w-node-_74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df83fd-69991345" data-w-id="74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df83fd" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
                <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                  <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">Does Innovorder work offline?</h3>
                  <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                    <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                  <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Because there's nothing more unpleasant than losing your Internet connection in the middle of a rush, our Innovorder cash register lets you cash your customers even when you're offline.<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div id="w-node-_74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df8407-69991345" data-w-id="74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df8407" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
                <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                  <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can I customize my cash register interface?</strong></h3>
                  <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                    <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                  <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Our tills offer a wide range of customization options, so you can tailor them to your specific needs. For example, you can adapt the touch plan of your cash register to the specific needs of your restaurant, by modifying menus, categories and products.<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div id="w-node-_74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df8412-69991345" data-w-id="74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df8412" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
                <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                  <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Does the cash register comply with current tax regulations?</strong></h3>
                  <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                    <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                  <div class="accordion-text---solutions">All our cash registers and cash register software have complied with the NF 525 standard since 2016. A certificate issued by Afnor guarantees that Innovorder cash registers comply with the law on the fight against VAT fraud in the event of an inspection by the tax authorities.<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div id="w-node-_74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df841d-69991345" data-w-id="74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df841d" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
                <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                  <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What are the advantages of a cash register?</strong></h3>
                  <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                    <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                  <div class="accordion-text---solutions">A connected cash register allows you to:<br>‍<br></div>
                  <ul role="list" class="bullets-expertise-block _17">
                    <li>Save time on collection and order management</li>
                    <li>Reduce data entry errors</li>
                    <li>Centralize all your sales and optimize your financial tracking</li>
                    <li>Simplify inventory management and sales reports</li>
                    <li>Enhance the customer experience with fast, seamless checkout</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div id="w-node-_74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df8435-69991345" data-w-id="74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df8435" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
                <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                  <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What are the main criteria for choosing a cash register?</strong></h3>
                  <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                    <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                  <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The main criterion is to match your needs. Your cash register must be adapted to your type of restaurant (fast food, traditional, food court, etc.), be intuitive for your teams and offer essential functionalities (order management, integrated payment, connection to kiosks, sales tracking, etc.).<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div id="w-node-_74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df8440-69991345" data-w-id="74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df8440" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
                <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                  <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How do you choose the right cash register for your restaurant?</strong></h3>
                  <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                    <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                  <div class="accordion-text---solutions">To help you make the right choice, take the following into account:<br>‍<br></div>
                  <ul role="list" class="bullets-expertise-block _17">
                    <li>Ease of use and ergonomics</li>
                    <li>Features (order management, payment, loyalty, etc.)</li>
                    <li>Compatibility with your existing tools (kiosks, delivery platforms, management software)</li>
                    <li>Compliance with tax legislation (NF525 certification)</li>
                    <li>Availability of customer support and software updates</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div id="w-node-_74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df8458-69991345" data-w-id="74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df8458" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
                <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                  <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can the cash register be connected to an order terminal?</strong></h3>
                  <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                    <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                  <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, all our Innovorder tills are synchronized with our order terminals. This streamlines the customer experience and automatically sends orders to the kitchen for faster, more efficient service.<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div id="w-node-_74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df8463-69991345" data-w-id="74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df8463" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
                <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                  <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can I join a loyalty program?</strong></h3>
                  <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                    <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                  <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, our checkouts are compatible with the Splio loyalty program.<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div id="w-node-_74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df846e-69991345" data-w-id="74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df846e" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
                <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                  <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What are the different Innovorder cases?</strong></h3>
                  <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                    <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                  <div class="accordion-text---solutions">We offer several models to suit your needs:<br>‍<br></div>
                  <ul role="list" class="bullets-expertise-block _17">
                    <li>Innovorder Nano: a compact, mobile box ideal for small spaces</li>
                    <li>Innovorder Move: a flexible cash register, perfect for dynamic restaurants</li>
                    <li>Innovorder Pro: a complete solution for facilities requiring advanced management</li>
                    <li>Innovorder Max: high-performance and robust, ideal for busy restaurants</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div id="w-node-_74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df8484-69991345" data-w-id="74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df8484" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
                <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                  <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Are software updates automatic and free?</strong></h3>
                  <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                    <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                  <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, all updates to our Innovorder checkouts are automatic and free of charge, guaranteeing a solution that's always up to date with the latest features and regulations.<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div id="w-node-_74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df848f-69991345" data-w-id="74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df848f" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
                <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                  <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can the cash register track sales in real time?</strong></h3>
                  <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                    <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                  <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, all sales data is accessible in real time from the back office, enabling instant analysis of performance and optimized decision-making.<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div id="w-node-_74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df849a-69991345" data-w-id="74cc40d1-6b41-1b95-f1ba-47da85df849a" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
                <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                  <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Is the Innovorder solution compatible with delivery platforms like Uber Eats or Deliveroo?</strong></h3>
                  <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                    <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                  <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, our tills can be connected to delivery platforms such as Uber Eats and Deliveroo, enabling seamless management of online orders directly from your till.<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
